_id":"f5d_cu0_k5x","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line015:m0228","start":228,"end":229,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":15,"last_line":15,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"蜀賊杜弢作亂，荊州刺史周顗退走，敦遣武昌太守陶侃、豫章太守周訪等討韜，而敦進住豫章，為諸軍繼援。及侃破弢，敦上侃為荊州刺史。既而侃為弢將杜曾所敗，敦以處分失所，自貶為廣武將軍，帝不許。侃之滅弢也，敦以元帥進鎮東大將軍、開府儀同三司，加都督江揚荊湘交廣六州諸軍事、江州刺史，封漢安侯。敦始自選置，兼統州郡焉。頃之，杜弢將杜弘南走廣州，求討桂林賊自效，敦許之。陶侃距弘不得進，乃詣零陵太守尹奉降，奉送弘與敦，敦以為將，遂見寵待。南康人何欽所居險固，聚黨數千人，敦就加四品將軍，於是專擅之跡漸彰矣。","raw_start":903,"raw_end":1149,"raw_line":15},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045","text":"敦至石頭，欲攻劉隗，其將杜弘曰：「劉隗死士眾多，未易可克，不如攻石頭。周劄少恩，兵不為用，攻之必敗。劄敗，則隗自走。」敦從之。劄果開城門納弘。諸將與敦戰，王師敗績。既入石頭，擁兵不朝，放肆兵士劫掠內外。官省奔散，惟有侍中二人侍帝。帝脫戎衣，著朝服，顧而言曰：「欲得我處，但當早道，我自還琅邪，何至困百姓如此！」敦收周顗、戴若思害之。以敦為丞相、江州牧，進爵武昌郡公，邑萬戶，使太常荀崧就拜，又加羽葆鼓吹，並偽讓不受。還屯武昌，多害忠良，寵樹親戚，以兄含為衛將軍、都督沔南軍事、領南蠻校尉、荊州刺史，以義陽太守任愔督河北諸軍事、南中郎將，敦又自督寧、益二州。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"劉隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"杜弘","kind":"person","person_id":"f85_nkp_oek","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"劉隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"周劄","kind":"person","person_id":"1a4_h3u_5rc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"劄","kind":"person","person_id":"1a4_h3u_5rc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"劄","kind":"person","person_id":"1a4_h3u_5rc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0069","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"f85_nkp_oek","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0155","start":155,"end":156,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"周顗","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0160","start":160,"end":163,"surface":"戴若思","kind":"person","person_id":"d9d_ab2_a72","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0167","start":1